{"4182190":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Too Deep To Quit","steam_appid":4182190,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/567822ac247b20192c4d0ff9be3001c7.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Too Deep To Quit<\/strong> is a 1-4 player co-op survival exploration game. Gather your team of adventurers, brave the dangers of cursed temples, and claim the ultimate treasure.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/d1c0772b7b1cc2c4946ea58fea9bd3cb.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/cbde07d5155d2cb67e61131932a956c2.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true adventurer knows how to improvise. These cursed temples hold a lot more than just gold, they’re packed with the leftovers of the poor saps who came before you. Check every dark corner for whatever keeps you breathing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/a81c931ee64232efb85aaf490bfca7a5.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, starving to death is bad, but getting squashed by the walls is definitely worse. Every hallway is a literal death trap waiting for the clumsy guy in your squad to mess up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/85994961aa516d1b0e369e65e561c963.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the traps don’t get you, the locals will. These forgotten temples are the perfect breeding ground for anything that slithers, stings, or bites. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/a217414723493305c4d991fadc06415a.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It belongs in a museum... but it’ll look way better in your bank account. Deep within these ruins lie priceless artifacts and solid gold idols just waiting to be claimed.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin