ry dark corner for whatever keeps you breathing.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/a81c931ee64232efb85aaf490bfca7a5.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/fe1c7e2061a728ae83618c7f6d128ef1.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure, starving to death is bad, but getting squashed by the walls is definitely worse. Every hallway is a literal death trap waiting for the clumsy guy in your squad to mess up.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/85994961aa516d1b0e369e65e561c963.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/2f0b9ab5af0df08f2e596d9507953b66.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the traps don’t get you, the locals will. These forgotten temples are the perfect breeding ground for anything that slithers, stings, or bites. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/a217414723493305c4d991fadc06415a.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=83 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.poster.avif?t=1791531119\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.webm?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/extras\/8d1e2c3c807a8965b90395f87211173c.mp4?t=1791531119\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It belongs in a museum... but it’ll look way better in your bank account. Deep within these ruins lie priceless artifacts and solid gold idols just waiting to be claimed.<\/p>","short_description":"Grab your gear and your friends for a hilarious, golden-age co-op adventure! Dive into cursed temples, hunt for the ultimate treasure, and work together to stay alive. Beware of everything and everyone... after all, only the survivors get to split the gold!","supported_languages":"English, French","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/5afabc0bdcc2efd0c69d745c291349460c1cffd2\/header.jpg?t=1791531119","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/6deeac0639641d670a3a6d947704043d173e1ad8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1791531119","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4182190\/6deeac0639641d670a3a6d947704043d173e1ad8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1791531119","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4590 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 \/ Intel Core i5 (Quad-Core)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 (8-core GPU) \/ AMD Radeon Pro 5300M<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13.0<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> : Apple M1 Pro \/ Intel Core i7<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 Pro (14-core GPU) \/ AMD Radeon Pro 5500M<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[]}}}